From e4af4075651883509b49efc9eaa23b220764e2ed Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: atomozero <bernardi.andrea@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 27 Oct 2026 07:20:28 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 42/63] tegra_dc: a display driver and accelerant for the
 NVIDIA Tegra 2

32 bit modes, brightness and display power, a hardware cursor on window
C, a video overlay on window B, and the HDMI output: mirroring of the
panel or a video on the whole HDMI screen, EDID with retries, HDMI or
DVI mode, audio from S/PDIF.

Signed-off-by: atomozero <bernardi.andrea@gmail.com>
